msgid "Iron Banners"
msgstr "铁旗战记"

msgid "Lead your banners in grid tactics and field battles."
msgstr "率领你的旗帜，进行格子战术与野战。"

msgid "Lookout"
msgstr "瞭望台"

msgid "To the lookout"
msgstr "前往瞭望台"

msgid "The whole valley lies below."
msgstr "整个山谷尽收眼底。"

msgid "Back to the start"
msgstr "返回起点"

msgid "Camp"
msgstr "营地"

msgid "War Table"
msgstr "战术桌"

msgid "Plan the Battle"
msgstr "筹划战斗"

msgid "Border Ford"
msgstr "边境渡口"

msgid "Strike"
msgstr "斩击"

msgid "Shoot"
msgstr "射击"

msgid "Mend"
msgstr "治疗"

msgid "Smash"
msgstr "重砸"

msgid "Firepot"
msgstr "火罐"

msgid "Volley"
msgstr "齐射"

msgid "Quake"
msgstr "震地"

msgid "Prayer"
msgstr "祈祷"

msgid "Shield Bash"
msgstr "盾击"

msgid "War Cry"
msgstr "战吼"

msgid "Swordsman"
msgstr "剑士"

msgid "Archer"
msgstr "弓手"

msgid "Cleric"
msgstr "牧师"

msgid "Raider"
msgstr "劫掠者"

msgid "Brute"
msgstr "蛮兵"

msgid "Slinger"
msgstr "投石手"

msgid "Muster"
msgstr "集结点"

msgid "Lead the Troops"
msgstr "率军出征"

msgid "Hill Pass"
msgstr "山口"

msgid "Spearman"
msgstr "长枪兵"

msgid "Bowman"
msgstr "弓兵"

msgid "Field Medic"
msgstr "军医"

msgid "Rider"
msgstr "骑兵"

msgid "Move with {move}. Press {interact} to use what is near."
msgstr "用 {move} 移动，按 {interact} 使用身旁的东西。"

msgid "A lost battle can be fought again whenever you are ready."
msgstr "打输的仗，准备好了随时可以再打一次。"

msgid "Captain Aldis"
msgstr "奥迪斯队长"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Captain Aldis"
msgstr "奥迪斯队长"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Welcome to camp. Raiders hold the ford and the hill pass, and we take both back."
msgstr "欢迎来到营地。掠夺者占着渡口和山口，我们要把两处都夺回来。"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "How do we fight at the ford?"
msgstr "渡口那一仗怎么打？"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Plan it on the war table. Each soldier moves and acts in turn; keep the cleric close to mend the wounded."
msgstr "在战术桌上筹划。士兵轮流移动和行动；让牧师跟紧些，好治疗伤员。"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "And the pass?"
msgstr "那山口呢？"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Lead the troops from the muster. Pick out soldiers, send them where they are needed, and they fight on their own."
msgstr "从集结点率军出发。选中士兵，派他们去需要的地方，他们会自己作战。"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "To work, then."
msgstr "那就开工吧。"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Good luck out there."
msgstr "祝你好运。"

msgid "Ford Held"
msgstr "守住渡口"

msgid "Win the battle at the Border Ford."
msgstr "赢下边境渡口之战。"

msgid "Pass Held"
msgstr "守住山口"

msgid "Win the battle in the Hill Pass."
msgstr "赢下山口之战。"

msgid "Veteran"
msgstr "老兵"

msgid "Defeat 50 raiders, counting every battle."
msgstr "击败 50 名敌人，所有战斗累计。"

msgid "Banner Bearer"
msgstr "执旗者"

msgid "Win at the ford and in the pass."
msgstr "在渡口与山口都取得胜利。"

msgid "Battles Won"
msgstr "赢下的战斗"

msgid "Raiders Defeated"
msgstr "击败的敌人"

msgid "Against the Odds"
msgstr "以寡敌众"

msgid "Win a battle with its foe strength on Strong."
msgstr "在敌人强度为「强」时赢下一场战斗。"

msgid "Hold the only ford over the river against the raiders."
msgstr "守住河上唯一的渡口，挡住劫掠者。"

msgid "Hold the pass between the hills as the raiders march on it. A second band follows 40 seconds behind."
msgstr "劫掠者向两山之间的山口进军，守住它。第二队人马在 40 秒后赶到。"

msgid "Old Mill"
msgstr "旧磨坊"

msgid "Raiders hold the mill across the stream. A bridge and a ford lead over. Fell their Warlord, and the band flees, though his war cry spurs on those around him. Two more raiders ride in from the east after 12 seconds of battle, unless he falls first. Win in the pass first, and a swordsman from there joins you."
msgstr "劫掠者占着溪对岸的磨坊。一座桥和一处浅滩通往对岸。击倒他们的匪首，匪众便会溃逃，但他的战吼会激励身边的匪众。战斗 12 秒后，又有两名劫掠者从东边赶来，除非匪首已先倒下。先在山口取胜，那里的一名剑士会来助战。"

msgid "Warlord"
msgstr "匪首"

msgid "Raider Camp"
msgstr "劫掠者营地"

msgid "The raiders wait behind their palisade. Storm it through the gate, and hold the fire at its heart for 20 seconds or defeat them all, before their main band rides home two minutes into the battle. Win at the ford first, and two spearmen from there join you."
msgstr "劫掠者守在木栅后面。从营门攻进去，守住营地中央的篝火 20 秒，或将他们全部击败，且须在战斗进行到两分钟、他们的大队人马返回之前完成。先在浅滩取胜，那里的两名枪兵会来助战。"

msgid "Mill Taken"
msgstr "夺回磨坊"

msgid "Win the battle at the Old Mill."
msgstr "赢下旧磨坊之战。"

msgid "Camp Stormed"
msgstr "踏破营寨"

msgid "Storm the Raider Camp."
msgstr "攻破劫掠者营地。"

msgid "Units Left"
msgstr "剩余兵力"

msgid "Master of the Field"
msgstr "沙场宗师"

msgid "Earn all three stars at each of the five battles."
msgstr "在全部五场战斗中各拿满三颗星。"

msgid "Watchtower"
msgstr "瞭望塔"

msgid "Raiders storm the watchtower to light its beacon and call their band. Hold its two doors: a raider who ends a turn on the beacon lights it, and the battle is lost. Three more raiders come 30 seconds into the battle, but the garrison rides in at 60: hold out until then, or fell them all. Storm the Raider Camp first, and an archer from there joins you."
msgstr "劫掠者猛攻瞭望塔，想点燃烽火召来同伙。守住塔的两道门：只要有劫掠者在烽火上结束回合，烽火便会燃起，此战即告失败。战斗 30 秒时又有三名劫掠者赶到，但守军会在第 60 秒驰援：坚守到那时，或将他们全部击倒。先攻下劫掠者营地，那里的一名弓手会来助战。"

msgid "Beacon Kept"
msgstr "烽火未燃"

msgid "Win the battle at the Watchtower."
msgstr "赢下瞭望塔之战。"
